    "articleBody": "While planning a new look for your workplace, gym, or your garden, the first thing that comes up in your mind is installing something that gives beauty with pleasure. Waterfalls are one of those decorative indoor interiors that give serenity and peace to your space. As per expert?s opinion, the dripping sound of water that keeps coming from the water fountain is a good therapy to treat anxiety and stress. So if you are looking into something that gives pleasure and beauty to your place at the same time, then indoor custom waterfalls are one of the best choices.  So, it is very important to know what the different types of indoor waterfalls are and where you should install them. We will discuss a few important answers to the most frequently asked questions:   \t Where should the interior water wall be placed?   The ideal place to install the water wall interior is the entrance of your workplace. The tropical fountain is often installed in the gardens. But unfortunately, not all of us are blessed with a lavish garden. So, in that case, the experts suggest installing the custom waterfalls and the interior water walls in the wealthy corners of your office space. By wealth corners, we mean southeast, north, and southwest.   \t What are the different materials of water walls interior?   The water wall interior can be made from various different materials like stones, metal, acrylic, glass, stainless steel, tiles, and other lots of materials. The selection of your material depends upon your choice and the area where you want to install the water wall fountain.   \t What are the benefits of building a custom waterfall?   There are many benefits of choosing a custom waterfall. Some of them are:  By choosing customized waterfalls, you can add LED lights and bubbling effects if you are installing them in your outdoor facility. This will enhance the beauty of the water falling on the rocks.  Another most highlighted benefit of customized waterfall is that there are many features that are pre-built in such fountain makes it look artificial. For example, too much lightning effect in the waterfall will make it look cheap. So to restore the harmony, you can make it customized the way you want.  The cost of waterfalls varies; depending upon the quality of material that is used in it and the beauty of the fountain, the cost is increased. But if your range doesn't fit with the readymade waterfalls, then you can make it customized the way you want, and in the budget you want.   \t What are the benefits of installing small tropical fountains?   Having a small water fountain in your facility is very important to give you peace of mind. And water is the symbol of peace, the falling sound of water and the glance at falling water gives you pleasure and takes your mind away from whole day stress of work and life. So even there is a small water fountain in your facility, it has many benefits, some of them are:  Connecting with nature is very important, especially when we live in big cities. Having plants, waterfalls and flowers connect human beings with nature.  The waterfalls, either it is indoor or outdoor, it is the best source of relaxing the mind. It can help to keep you away from many health issues like depression, anxiety, and insomnia.  The water gives extra positive energy to your mind and soul, and you become more productive.  The water, when collides with anything, generates negative ions, and these negative ions are highly beneficial for human health.  So to conclude, it can be said that there are many styles and forms of water fountains available you can choose one, according to your facility. You can install one and keep your mind away from stress and anxiety.",
